 causal boundary rules    
     event boundaries one event ends next begins \n 
     - start new event whenever world state changes object becomes  
     held gripper closes object released gripper opens stays put object reaches new location lid door drawer  
     changes open closed state tool starts stops affecting surface contents visibly move  e g  poured  \n single action changes same state gradually continuously   
     keep one event split n same action repeats different objects target locations   
     treat each repetition separate event \n create boundaries idle time  camera motion  hesitation tiny hand adjustments  
 


